# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the deployed output.
#
# Referrer-Policy is the one that matters here, and it is not boilerplate. The crisis
# page links out to Befrienders Kenya, the Samaritans, 988 and others. With the
# browser default those sites would receive a Referer header saying the visitor came
# from an anonymous mental-health support site — a disclosure the person did not make
# and would not expect. no-referrer stops it.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
